    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of mystical mastery in <i>Mage Blast</i>! This indie pixel-art idle/incremental game puts you in the robes of a powerful mage, progressing through an arcane world of limitless potential. Hone your skills, craft legendary artifacts, and build an unstoppable arsenal of magical spells and modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade your skills to unleash ever-greater magical power. Experiment with different playstyles to discover the most efficient path to ascension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Strategize with Attack Modifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a deck of modifiers that enhance your attacks\u2014trigger devastating critical hits, amplify damage output, and activate temporary bonuses. Your strategy will define your success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Crafting: The Key to Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts and magical items to unlock new abilities and deepen your mastery. Craft specialized attack modifiers to further enhance your spellcasting potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Expand and Enhance Your Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of spells, each with unique attributes. Strengthen and refine them to deal massive damage and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning pixel visuals, an engaging progression system, and endless possibilities, <i>Mage\u00a0 Blast</i>\u00a0is the ultimate magical journey for idle game enthusiasts. Will you rise as the ultimate arcane master?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of mystical mastery in <i>Mage Blast</i>! This indie pixel-art idle/incremental game puts you in the robes of a powerful mage, progressing through an arcane world of limitless potential. Hone your skills, craft legendary artifacts, and build an unstoppable arsenal of magical spells and modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/077b8f3b91eea9db67a99a86ca808910.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade your skills to unleash ever-greater magical power. Experiment with different playstyles to discover the most efficient path to ascension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Strategize with Attack Modifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/64a85cf89f308e1e95b9f48429f596a6.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a deck of modifiers that enhance your attacks\u2014trigger devastating critical hits, amplify damage output, and activate temporary bonuses. Your strategy will define your success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Crafting: The Key to Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/7bf5c237212e5d76056669bcf07c08d3.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts and magical items to unlock new abilities and deepen your mastery. Craft specialized attack modifiers to further enhance your spellcasting potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Expand and Enhance Your Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.poster.avif?t=1750265812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.webm?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/6a1e95f61ebdb24fac0c41e4de625b1a.mp4?t=1750265812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of spells, each with unique attributes. Strengthen and refine them to deal massive damage and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning pixel visuals, an engaging progression system, and endless possibilities, <i>Mage\u00a0 Blast</i>\u00a0is the ultimate magical journey for idle game enthusiasts. Will you rise as the ultimate arcane master?</p>",
    "short_description": "Forge arcane might in this semi-idle deckbuilder! Craft spells layer by layer\u2014turn a simple fireball into a barrage of flaming meteors. Build a deck of modifiers to trigger explosive combos, explore ancient realms for rare resources, and stitch together magic unlike anything the world has seen.",
